{"name":"Sandstorm","hex":"#ecd540","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sandstorm","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A strong wind carrying clouds of sand and dust through the air."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sandstorm"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sandstorm (instrumental)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Sandstorm\" is an instrumental by Finnish DJ and record producer Darude, released as the lead single from his debut studio album, Before the Storm (2000). It was initially released in Finland on 26 October 1999 by 16 Inch Records and was released worldwide throughout 2000. The track was uploaded to MP3.com, where it gained global recognition. It has also gained recognition for its usage in sports and popularity in internet meme culture. Its music video was directed by Juuso Syrjä, a.k.a. Uzi, and filmed on site in Helsinki."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/98/Sandstorm_single.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandstorm_(instrumental)"},{"title":"Sandstorm (Cast song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Sandstorm\" is a song by the Liverpool Britpop band Cast. The song is the third single released from the band's debut studio album, All Change (1995). \"Sandstorm\" peaked at number eight on the UK Singles Chart in January 1996."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/25/Cast_-_Sandstorm_cover_art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandstorm_(Cast_song)"},{"title":"Dust storm","blocks":[{"text":"A dust storm, also called a sandstorm, is a meteorological phenomenon common in arid and semi-arid regions. Dust storms arise when a gust front or other strong wind blows loose sand and dirt from a dry surface. Fine particles are transported by saltation and suspension, a process that moves soil from one place and deposits it in another. These storms can reduce visibility, disrupt transportation, and pose serious health risks. Over time, repeated dust storms can reduce agricultural productivity and contribute to desertification."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Sandsturm_in_der_Namib_%282017%29.jpg/330px-Sandsturm_in_der_Namib_%282017%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dust_storm"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Roland_JP-8080.jpg/330px-Roland_JP-8080.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Roland_JP-8080.jpg/330px-Roland_JP-8080.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Roland JP-8080 synthesizer used in \"Sandstorm\" (pictured); displaying \"sand storm\" on its screen, from which the title is derived.[7]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARoland_JP-8080.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/N%C3%A4kym%C3%A4_Huvilakujaa_pitkin_pohjoiseen_-_G39834_-_hkm.HKMS000005-km0000p9mb.jpg/500px-N%C3%A4kym%C3%A4_Huvilakujaa_pitkin_pohjoiseen_-_G39834_-_hkm.HKMS000005-km0000p9mb.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/N%C3%A4kym%C3%A4_Huvilakujaa_pitkin_pohjoiseen_-_G39834_-_hkm.HKMS000005-km0000p9mb.jpg/1280px-N%C3%A4kym%C3%A4_Huvilakujaa_pitkin_pohjoiseen_-_G39834_-_hkm.HKMS000005-km0000p9mb.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/N%C3%A4kym%C3%A4_Huvilakujaa_pitkin_pohjoiseen_-_G39834_-_hkm.HKMS000005-km0000p9mb.jpg/500px-N%C3%A4kym%C3%A4_Huvilakujaa_pitkin_pohjoiseen_-_G39834_-_hkm.HKMS000005-km0000p9mb.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Huvilakuja in Ullanlinna, one of the streets seen in the video","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AN%C3%A4kym%C3%A4_Huvilakujaa_pitkin_pohjoiseen_-_G39834_-_hkm.HKMS000005-km0000p9mb.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Global_movement_of_dust_from_an_Asian_dust_storm_animation.gif/500px-Global_movement_of_dust_from_an_Asian_dust_storm_animation.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Global_movement_of_dust_from_an_Asian_dust_storm_animation.gif/500px-Global_movement_of_dust_from_an_Asian_dust_storm_animation.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Animation showing the global movement of dust from an Asian dust storm.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGlobal_movement_of_dust_from_an_Asian_dust_storm_animation.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/A_Sand_Wind_on_the_Desert.jpg/500px-A_Sand_Wind_on_the_Desert.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/A_Sand_Wind_on_the_Desert.jpg/1280px-A_Sand_Wind_on_the_Desert.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/A_Sand_Wind_on_the_Desert.jpg/500px-A_Sand_Wind_on_the_Desert.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dust storm in Sahara, painted by George Francis Lyon","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA_Sand_Wind_on_the_Desert.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Sydney_harbour_bridge_duststorm.jpg/500px-Sydney_harbour_bridge_duststorm.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Sydney_harbour_bridge_duststorm.jpg/128